Package: trashwheelexplorer
Title: Explore What Baltimore's Trash Wheels Collect
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Krrish", "Jambhulkar", , "kjam0022@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a tidy dataset of dumpster collections from
    Baltimore's Trash Wheels, a function that summarises estimated
    rubbish counts by wheel and year, and a Shiny app for exploring
    what each wheel collects over time.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
